<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Dataset and domain wise results</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section presents cost-performance trade-offs across different datasets and domains with <math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> reward function in Figures <a href="#A4.F8" title="Figure 8 ‣ D.1 Dataset-wise results ‣ Appendix D Dataset and domain wise results ‣ One Head, Many Models: Cross-Attention Routing for Cost-Aware LLM Selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a>
–<a href="#A4.F9" title="Figure 9 ‣ D.2 Domain-wise results ‣ Appendix D Dataset and domain wise results ‣ One Head, Many Models: Cross-Attention Routing for Cost-Aware LLM Selection" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>.</p>
</div>
